From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +000
Subject: [PATCH] emitterutils: include cstdint for fixed-width types

emitterutils.cpp uses uint16_t and uint32_t directly. Newer libstdc++
headers no longer make those typedefs visible here through incidental
includes, so GCC 15 fails the build.

Signed-off-by: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
---
 src/emitterutils.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/emitterutils.cpp b/src/emitterutils.cpp
index 4e85f53..f2562f7 100644
--- a/src/emitterutils.cpp
+++ b/src/emitterutils.cpp
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <iomanip>
 #include <sstream>
 
-- 
